CICD - Flow
=============
github (commit) --> webhook --> jenkins triggers ---> CI  ---> CD 

CI 
----
checkout(git) --> Build & Unit Test (maven)--> Code scan (docker)--> Image build (docker) ---> image scan(trivy) --> image push (ECR)

CD 
----
git (Helm charts)  --> update k8s manifest --> ArgoCD ---> kubernates

free style job - only declarative 
pipeline - declarative as well as scripted 



